Package: ofhsyn
Type: Package
Title: Synthetic Linked Health Cohort Data Generator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Hannah", family = "Nicholls", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hannahnicholls@qmul.ac.uk")
Author: Hannah Nicholls [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Hannah Nicholls <hannahnicholls@qmul.ac.uk>
Description: Generates synthetic linked health datasets for method development,
    including participant, questionnaire, clinic measurements, outpatient,
    inpatient, emergency, mortality, primary care medication, and geography
    outputs. Supports reproducible generation with configurable cohort size and
    user-defined ICD-10, OPCS-4, and BNF code pools.
